Z||000002||ThatRickGuy||05-30-2001||03:01 PM||||Next year it is, by then I'll have a lot more work finished on it hopefully. <P>On a side note, I ordered my new exhaust 2 weeks ago from the Fiero Store, UPS messed up and it got sent to my billing address (being a military mail room) and the rejected it. I talked to FS about it and they were supper cool, waived the shipping and sent it back out again to the correct address. It showed up today, which is unfortunatly a game night, then tomorrow I leave for a friends wedding, and I won't be back till sunday, then the shop will be closed till wednesday... GEAHH!!! I just want my car to sound decent! :P But anyways, you may pay a bit more at the Fiero Store, but the customer service and quality is great!||||reg||1
